_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**To reproduce:**\r\n\r\nhttps://lesscss.org/less-preview/#\r\n\r\n```less\r\n.main{  \r\n  @layer{\r\n    &::before{\r\n      color:#f00;\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Current behavior:**\r\nNesting selector `&` lost in `@layer`.\r\nBut other @ rules works well, such as `@media`, `@container` etc.\r\n```less\r\n@layer {\r\n  ::before {\r\n    color: #f00;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior:**\r\nNesting selector `&` resolved as its scope selector.\r\n```less\r\n@layer {\r\n  .main::before {\r\n    color: #f00;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Environment information:**\r\n\r\n- `less` version: 4.2.0\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"puckowski","id":3059609,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTk2MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3059609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski","html_url":"https://github.com/puckowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puckowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/4242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/4242/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}